# The pilot works on full source-paper text. This repository is public, so
# only the code and schema contracts are tracked. Everything else holds source
# text, quotations drawn from it, or measurements derived per paper.
#
# The allowlist names files explicitly on purpose: a glob such as !*.py would
# also track scratch probe scripts, which routinely have source text pasted
# into them. Add a new script here deliberately, or write it to /tmp.
*
!.gitignore
!bindings.py
!compact.py
!evaluate.py
!pilot.py
!round6_report.py
!round7_report.py
!test_bindings.py
!test_compact.py
!test_pilot.py
!format.json
!format-v2.json
!format-v3.json
!format-v4.json
